        "type": "process-procedure",
        "title": "SecOps-NG",
        "description": "SecOps-NG is a community-driven Digital Commons of portable security operations content (CACAO playbooks, OSCAL/D3FEND control mappings, OCSF data shapes, KPI/KRI catalog) plus reference compilers to n8n, Temporal, and LangGraph. This component definition exposes how the SecOps-NG content set addresses NIS2 Article 21 risk-management measures and Article 23 incident-notification obligations.",
